          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಚಂಡಮಾರುತ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಚಂಡಮಾರುತ — caṇḍamāruta — \"a cyclone\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಚಂಡಮಾರುತದಿಂದ ಮೀನುಗಾರರು ಸಮುದ್ರಕ್ಕೆ ಹೋಗಲಿಲ್ಲ. caṇḍamārutadinda mīnugāraru samudrakke hōgalilla. Because of the cyclone the fishermen did not go to sea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಚಂಡ, fierce, plus ಮಾರುತ, wind."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಚಂಡಮಾರುತ (caṇḍamāruta) is built from two Sanskrit words: caṇḍa, \"passionate, fierce\" (CDIAL 4584), and māruta, \"windy; the wind\" (CDIAL 10068)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
