            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸುಂಟರಗಾಳಿ — suṇṭaragāḷi — \"a whirlwind\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸುಂಟರಗಾಳಿ ಹೊಲದ ಧೂಳನ್ನು ಮೇಲಕ್ಕೆ ಎತ್ತಿತು. suṇṭaragāḷi holada dhūḷannu mēlakke ettitu. A whirlwind lifted the dust of the field up into the air."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A spinning wind; ಬಿರುಗಾಳಿ is a storm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
