          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸುಂಟರಗಾಳಿ (suṇṭaragāḷi) ends in native ಗಾಳಿ, \"wind, air\" (DEDR 1499); the source of its first part, suṇṭara, is not settled."
            }
