              "text": "ಸುನಾಮಿಯಿಂದ ಕರಾವಳಿಯ ಹಳ್ಳಿಗಳು ನಾಶವಾದವು. sunāmiyinda karāvaḷiya haḷḷigaḷu nāśavādavu. Coastal villages were destroyed by the tsunami."
